# Backstop denylist for the published npm package.
#
# The operative mechanism is package.json "files", which ships only
# "wiki/shared" — the shared subdirectory is the publication unit, and
# everything directly under wiki/ is fold-local by construction. This
# list is dormant under that rule. It activates only if "files" is ever
# loosened back to the whole directory ("wiki") or a glob ("wiki/*.md"),
# keeping draft artifacts from leaking into a publish even then.
#
# Files listed here remain fully visible to the local daemon's wiki
# tools (list_wiki / search_wiki / read_wiki) — this only curates the
# tarball. It does not keep anything private: every file in this
# directory is in the source repository npm publishes from
# (docs/releasing.md), so a page that must stay private does not belong
# in this checkout at all.
*.scribe.json
